<title>NEW ZEALAND: Seafresh announces NZ$0.05 cps dividend.</title>
<headline>Seafresh announces NZ$0.05 cps dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seafresh New Zealand Ltd on Monday announced a NZ$0.5 cents per share dividend with a record Date of February 14, and ex-dividend date of February 17 and a pay date of February 27.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
